{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104925","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104925/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104925/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104925/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104925","id":2966554975,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6w0glf","number":104925,"title":"Unique nested resources are indistinguishable from shared resources in Inspector","user":{"login":"michaelgundlach","id":5141333,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNDEzMzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5141333?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelgundlach","html_url":"https://github.com/michaelgundlach","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelgundlach/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelgundlach/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelgundlach/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelgundlach/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelgundlach/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelgundlach/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelgundlach/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelgundlach/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelgundlach/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-04-02T14:23:02Z","updated_at":"2025-04-02T15:48:03Z","closed_at":"2025-04-02T15:48:00Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nAll\n\n### System information\n\nN/A\n\n### Issue description\n\nThere is no visible indication to the user whether a nested resource has been Made Unique.  As a result, users may change a nested shared resource, assuming it is unique, and cause unintended changes elsewhere that the resource is referenced.\n\nColoring unique resources hot pink when expanded (rather than the purple that is the default theme), and/or changing their icon from a box to a box with an asterisk in it, would go a long way toward reducing accidental errors, and frustration with users who are new to using resources.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a `child.tres` file for custom resource `Child`, then a `parent.tres` file for a custom resource `Parent` who has an `@export var child: Child`.  Point `parent.tres:child` to `child.tres`.\n\nMake Unique `parent.tres:child` in the inspector.\n\n**Expected behavior**:\n\nVisual indication of the Unique status of `parent.tres:child`.\n\n**Actual result**:\n\nNo visual indication.  Users must know to hover over the `child` value to see if a .tres appears in the tooltip, or drill down to `parent.tres:child` -> **Resource** group -> `resource_path` and perhaps scroll the text field to the right to determine whether it ends in \".tres\" or \"::Resource_x1y2z\".\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"